import '../styles/styles.scss';
---

<Layout>
	<Navbar />

<div class="winogrand-text">
    <div class="title">Lessons with Winogrand</div>
    In 1970, teachers and students from the Rochester Institute of Technology interviewed Garry Winogrand, an American photographer. By transforming an interview, lessons with winogrand is meant to celebrate the influence, and the processes he works with. The excerpts chosen in the booklet were specific quotes of interest.

</div>

<div class="image-content">
    <img src="/images/wino_cover.webp" alt="lessons with winogrand" />
    <img src="/images/wino.webp" alt="lessons with winogrand" />
    <img src="/images/wino_open.webp" alt="lessons with winogrand" />
</div>
</Layout>
